# smithy-php monorepo -> per-package split map
# Format: <src-subdir> <composer-package-name> <split-repo-slug>
# One line per package. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The split repo URL is built as: git@github.com:${SPLIT_ORG}/<split-repo-slug>.git
#
# Rows are in dependency order (a package comes after the packages it needs).
# If a <src-subdir> is missing from the working tree the split script skips it
# and logs a notice.

Async       smithy/async        smithy-php-async
Core        smithy/core         smithy-php-core
Codec       smithy/codec        smithy-php-codec
Http        smithy/http         smithy-php-http
Auth        smithy/auth         smithy-php-auth
Protocol    smithy/protocol     smithy-php-protocol
ProtocolAws smithy/protocol-aws smithy-php-protocol-aws
Client      smithy/client       smithy-php-client
Codegen     smithy/codegen      smithy-php-codegen
